            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-12T16:47:01.981433+00:00",
            "notes": "[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is a must-buy as Juno very easily gets full stacks with one use of her Primary Fire (so long as all five bullets hit). This paired up with the other abilities should get you a nice 20/20 split which with full stacks is more like a 20/45 split - which you will ideally have at (almost) all times.\nWith getting the Power [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) as well, most low health enemies should die so long as you hit them, even if they run behind cover. This allows you to essentially jiggle-peek the enemies, only coming out to hit them, wait out the DoT only to repeat the same pattern.\nHowever, if healing is not an issue, you can 100% get [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) early as it helps you get assists early.",
