            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-12T16:47:01.981433+00:00",
            "notes": "With Round 4 you can either already get [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) which now that you have [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) applies the Healing Reduction on hit, since you now deal Ability Damage with your Primary Fire or go with [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) as it not only gives more [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) but also helps you gain Ultimate Charge easier.\nIf you, however, need survivability, sell one of your purple Items for either [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you aren't dying as bad, but if they be jumping you left and right, go for [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).",
