            "notes": "**Finally in Round 7, you fill any holes you may have. Let's start with the Powers:**\n[Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) if you need better healing in general.\n[Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) if you need more Torpedos overall.\n[Rally Ring](item_0547012b-4817-437e-aad3-aa37db93383e) if you need more uses of your Hyperring for Overhealth ([Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca)).\n\n**Now for the Items:**\n*Debuffing*: [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98).\n*Survivability*: [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n*Ultimate*: [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)\n*[Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*: [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce), [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e), [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n*Overall Balancing*: [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n*Weapon Healing*: [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b)\n*Misc.*: [Pulse Spike](item_6557a6d1-9c94-4635-9619-67257e26683e), [Sunburst Serum](item_a24151e7-1172-409e-a874-30f949006bfa), [PulStar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648)\n\nPersonal Note: At the end, your split should AT LEAST be 15/60 *(Build Cost: 55,250)*, 15/85 with full stacks, but ideally you want to of course aim for higher.",
